Gods depart praising Rāma's valor and Sugrīva's counsel --- Rāma dismisses Mātali with Indra's chariot --- Mātali ascends to heaven --- Rāma embraces Sugrīva and reaches camp --- Rāma asks Lakṣmaṇa to crown Vibhīṣaṇa --- Lakṣmaṇa consecrates Vibhīṣaṇa with golden jar --- Citizens bring auspicious gifts for Rāma --- Rāma sends Hanumān to tell Sītā of safety and Rāvaṇa's death
